# The Hard closer ([[campaign-ledger]]): the champion inherits close 0
# from close0-flame4, so it NEVER all-ins -- and the ladder
# certification's one non-win (champ-s8720577) is a full-cap
# stalemate, alive with 13.7k army against a rival it never marched
# on. One knob: close 3, the dominance release every pre-champion
# doctrine carried. Everything else is evolve1-g4m2 exactly.
